數過多"},{code:"32",name:"EPIPE",msg:"Broken pipe",note:"寫入時對方已關閉（會同時收到 SIGPIPE）"},{code:"33",name:"EDOM",msg:"Numerical argument out of domain",note:"數學函式的引數超出定義域"},{code:"34",name:"ERANGE",msg:"Numerical result out of range",note:"結果超出範圍，或緩衝區太小"},{code:"35",name:"EDEADLK",msg:"Resource deadlock avoided",note:"偵測到鎖死"},{code:"36",name:"ENAMETOOLONG",msg:"File name too long",note:"檔名或路徑太長"},{code:"37",name:"ENOLCK",msg:"No locks available",note:"沒有可用的鎖"},{code:"38",name:"ENOSYS",msg:"Function not implemented",note:"這個系統呼叫在目前核心／架構沒實作"},{code:"39",name:"ENOTEMPTY",msg:"Directory not empty",note:"資料夾不是空的，無法刪除"},{code:"40",name:"ELOOP",msg:"Too many levels of symbolic links",note:"符號連結層級太多（可能形成迴圈）"},{code:"61",name:"ENODATA",msg:"No data available",note:"沒有資料（例如 getxattr 找不到該屬性）"},{code:"62",name:"ETIME",msg:"Timer expired",note:"計時器逾時"},{code:"71",name:"EPROTO",msg:"Protocol error",note:"協定錯誤"},{code:"74",name:"EBADMSG",msg:"Bad message",note:"訊息格式錯誤"},{code:"75",name:"EOVERFLOW",msg:"Value too large for defined data type",note:"值太大，放不進資料型別"},{code:"84",name:"EILSEQ",msg:"Invalid or incomplete multibyte or wide character",note:"多位元組字元序列無效（編碼不符）"},{code:"88",name:"ENOTSOCK",msg:"Socket operation on non-socket",note:"對非 socket 做了 socket 操作"},{code:"89",name:"EDESTADDRREQ",msg:"Destination address required",note:"需要目的位址"},{code:"90",name:"EMSGSIZE",msg:"Message too long",note:"訊息太長（超過 UDP／socket 限制）"},{code:"91",name:"EPROTOTYPE",msg:"Protocol wrong type for socket",note:"socket 類型與協定不符"},{code:"92",name:"ENOPROTOOPT",msg:"Protocol not available",note:"這個協定不支援該選項"},{code:"93",name:"EPROTONOSUPPORT",msg:"Protocol not supported",note:"不支援這個協定"},{code:"95",name:"EOPNOTSUPP",msg:"Operation not supported",note:"這個操作不被支援（也是 ENOTSUP）"},{code:"97",name:"EAFNOSUPPORT",msg:"Address family not supported by protocol",note:"不支援的位址家族"},{code:"98",name:"EADDRINUSE",msg:"Address already in use",note:"位址（埠號）已被使用；伺服器重啟時常見，可設 SO_REUSEADDR"},{code:"99",name:"EADDRNOTAVAIL",msg:"Cannot assign requested address",note:"無法使用該位址（本機沒有這個 IP）"},{code:"100",name:"ENETDOWN",msg:"Network is down",note:"網路介面停用"},{code:"101",name:"ENETUNREACH",msg:"Network is unreachable",note:"網路不可達（沒有路由）"},{code:"103",name:"ECONNABORTED",msg:"Software caused connection abort",note:"連線被本機軟體中止"},{code:"104",name:"ECONNRESET",msg:"Connection reset by peer",note:"連線被對方重設（對方行程崩潰、防火牆、對方強制關閉）"},{code:"105",name:"ENOBUFS",msg:"No buffer space available",note:"沒有緩衝區空間"},{code:"106",name:"EISCONN",msg:"Transport endpoint is already connected",note:"已經連線"},{code:"107",name:"ENOTCONN",msg:"Transport endpoint is not connected",note:"尚未連線"},{code:"110",name:"ETIMEDOUT",msg:"Connection timed out",note:"連線逾時（對方沒回應或被防火牆丟棄）"},{code:"111",name:"ECONNREFUSED",msg:"Connection refused",note:"連線被拒絕（對方埠沒有服務在聽）"},{code:"112",name:"EHOSTDOWN",msg:"Host is down",note:"主機關機"},{code:"113",name:"EHOSTUNREACH",msg:"No route to host",note:"找不到通往主機的路由"},{code:"114",name:"EALREADY",msg:"Operation already in progress",note:"操作已在進行中"},{code:"115",name:"EINPROGRESS",msg:"Operation now in progress",note:"非阻塞連線正在進行（要等可寫再檢查 SO_ERROR）"},{code:"116",name:"ESTALE",msg:"Stale file handle",note:"檔案控制代碼過期（NFS）"},{code:"122",name:"EDQUOT",msg:"Disk quota exceeded",note:"超過磁碟配額"},{code:"125",name:"ECANCELED",msg:"Operation canceled",note:"操作被取消"},{code:"130",name:"EOWNERDEAD",msg:"Owner died",note:"持有互斥鎖的行程已死"},{code:"131",name:"ENOTRECOVERABLE",msg:"State not recoverable",note:"狀態無法復原"},{code:"133",name:"EHWPOISON",msg:"Memory page has hardware error",note:"記憶體頁有硬體錯誤"},{code:"512",name:"ERESTARTSYS",msg:"To be restarted if SA_RESTART is set",note:"核心內部：被訊號打斷、可能重啟（不會傳到使用者空間）"}],signal:[{code:"1",name:"SIGHUP",msg:"Hangup",note:"終端機掛斷或控制行程結束；常用來通知常駐程式重新讀設定"},{code:"2",name:"SIGINT",msg:"Interrupt",note:"使用者按 Ctrl+C"},{code:"3",name:"SIGQUIT",msg:"Quit",note:"使用者按 Ctrl+\\，會產生 core dump"},{code:"4",name:"SIGILL",msg:"Illegal instruction",note:"執行了非法指令（跑錯架構的程式、程式碼損毀、用了 CPU 不支援的指令）"},{code:"5",name:"SIGTRAP",msg:"Trace/breakpoint trap",note:"除錯中斷點（int3）"},{code:"6",name:"SIGABRT",msg:"Aborted",note:"程式呼叫 abort()：assert 失敗、glibc 偵測到 heap 損毀、未捕捉的 C++ 例外"},{code:"7",name:"SIGBUS",msg:"Bus error",note:"匯流排錯誤：未對齊存取、存取 mmap 檔案已被截斷的區域"},{code:"8",name:"SIGFPE",msg:"Floating point exception",note:"算術例外：整數除以零、溢位（不一定是浮點）"},{code:"9",name:"SIGKILL",msg:"Killed",note:"被強制結束，無法捕捉；常是 OOM killer 或 kill -9"},{code:"10",name:"SIGUSR1",msg:"User defined signal 1",note:"使用者自訂訊號 1"},{code:"11",name:"SIGSEGV",msg:"Segmentation fault",note:"存取了無效記憶體位址：空指標、野指標、堆疊溢位、寫入唯讀區"},{code:"12",name:"SIGUSR2",msg:"User defined signal 2",note:"使用者自訂訊號 2"},{code:"13",name:"SIGPIPE",msg:"Broken pipe",note:"寫入已關閉的管線或 socket（預設會終止行程；伺服器常設為忽略）"},{code:"14",name:"SIGALRM",msg:"Alarm clock",note:"alarm() 計時到"},{code:"15",name:"SIGTERM",msg:"Terminated",note:"請求結束（kill 預設、systemd stop），可以捕捉做清理"},{code:"17",name:"SIGCHLD",msg:"Child exited",note:"子行程結束或暫停"},{code:"18",name:"SIGCONT",msg:"Continued",note:"繼續被暫停的行程"},{code:"19",name:"SIGSTOP",msg:"Stopped (signal)",note:"暫停行程，無法捕捉"},{code:"20",name:"SIGTSTP",msg:"Stopped",note:"使用者按 Ctrl+Z"},{code:"24",name:"SIGXCPU",msg:"CPU time limit exceeded",note:"超過 CPU 時間限制"},{code:"25",name:"SIGXFSZ",msg:"File size limit exceeded",note:"超過檔案大小限制"},{code:"31",name:"SIGSYS",msg:"Bad system call",note:"錯誤的系統呼叫（被 seccomp 擋下常見）"}],exit:[{code:"0",name:"SUCCESS",msg:"Success",note:"成功"},{code:"1",name:"GENERAL",msg:"General error",note:"一般性錯誤（程式自訂；很多工具用 1 表示失敗；grep 用 1 表示沒找到）"},{code:"2",name:"MISUSE",msg:"Misuse of shell builtins / usage error",note:"用法錯誤：參數不對（bash 內建與許多 CLI 的慣例）"},{code:"126",name:"NOT_EXECUTABLE",msg:"Command invoked cannot execute",note:"找到命令但不能執行（沒有執行權限、是資料夾、格式不對）"},{code:"127",name:"NOT_FOUND",msg:"Command not found",note:"找不到命令（PATH 沒有、拼錯、或腳本的直譯器路徑不存在）"},{code:"128",name:"INVALID_EXIT",msg:"Invalid argument to exit",note:"exit 的引數無效"},{code:"130",name:"SIGINT",msg:"Terminated by Ctrl+C",note:"被 Ctrl+C（SIGINT）結束，即 128+2"},{code:"134",name:"SIGABRT",msg:"Aborted",note:"被 SIGABRT 結束，即 128+6（assert／abort）"},{code:"137",name:"SIGKILL",msg:"Killed",note:"被 SIGKILL 結束，即 128+9（OOM killer 或 kill -9；容器記憶體超限常見）"},{code:"139",name:"SIGSEGV",msg:"Segmentation fault",note:"被 SIGSEGV 結束，即 128+11（記憶體存取錯誤）"},{code:"141",name:"SIGPIPE",msg:"Broken pipe",note:"被 SIGPIPE 結束，即 128+13"},{code:"143",name:"SIGTERM",msg:"Terminated",note:"被 SIGTERM 結束，即 128+15（正常的停止請求）"},{code:"255",name:"OUT_OF_RANGE",msg:"Exit status out of range",note:"退出碼超出範圍或 ssh 連線層級失敗（ssh 用 255 表示連線錯誤）"}],win32:[{code:"0",name:"ERROR_SUCCESS",msg:"The operation completed successfully.",note:"成功"},{code:"1",name:"ERROR_INVALID_FUNCTION",msg:"Incorrect function.",note:"功能無效（常見：對不支援的裝置呼叫 DeviceIoControl）"},{code:"2",name:"ERROR_FILE_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The system cannot find the file specified.",note:"找不到檔案（路徑、檔名錯誤）"},{code:"3",name:"ERROR_PATH_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The system cannot find the path specified.",note:"找不到路徑（中間的資料夾不存在）"},{code:"4",name:"ERROR_TOO_MANY_OPEN_FILES",msg:"The system cannot open the file.",note:"開啟的檔案太多"},{code:"5",name:"ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED",msg:"Access is denied.",note:"存取被拒：權限不足、需要以系統管理員身分執行、檔案被獨占鎖定、UAC／完整性層級"},{code:"6",name:"ERROR_INVALID_HANDLE",msg:"The handle is invalid.",note:"控制代碼無效（已關閉、未初始化、類型不對）"},{code:"8",name:"ERROR_NOT_ENOUGH_MEMORY",msg:"Not enough memory resources are available to process this command.",note:"記憶體不足"},{code:"13",name:"ERROR_INVALID_DATA",msg:"The data is invalid.",note:"資料無效"},{code:"14",name:"ERROR_OUTOFMEMORY",msg:"Not enough storage is available to complete this operation.",note:"記憶體（儲存空間）不足"},{code:"15",name:"ERROR_INVALID_DRIVE",msg:"The system cannot find the drive specified.",note:"找不到磁碟機代號"},{code:"17",name:"ERROR_NOT_SAME_DEVICE",msg:"The system cannot move the file to a different disk drive.",note:"不能跨磁碟移動"},{code:"18",name:"ERROR_NO_MORE_FILES",msg:"There are no more files.",note:"列舉已經結束（FindNextFile 的正常結尾，不是錯誤）"},{code:"19",name:"ERROR_WRITE_PROTECT",msg:"The media is write protected.",note:"媒體寫入保護"},{code:"21",name:"ERROR_NOT_READY",msg:"The device is not ready.",note:"裝置未就緒（光碟機沒碟、網路磁碟機斷線）"},{code:"23",name:"ERROR_CRC",msg:"Data error (cyclic redundancy check).",note:"資料錯誤（CRC），常是儲存媒體損壞"},{code:"24",name:"ERROR_BAD_LENGTH",msg:"The program issued a command but the command length is incorrect.",note:"命令長度不對（結構大小欄位沒設）"},{code:"31",name:"ERROR_GEN_FAILURE",msg:"A device attached to the system is not functioning.",note:"連接的裝置無法運作（一般裝置失敗）"},{code:"32",name:"ERROR_SHARING_VIOLATION",msg:"The process cannot access the file because it is being used by another process.",note:"檔案被另一個行程以不相容的共用模式開著（防毒、編輯器、另一個執行個體）"},{code:"33",name:"ERROR_LOCK_VIOLATION",msg:"The process cannot access the file because another process has locked a portion of the file.",note:"檔案區段被別的行程鎖住"},{code:"38",name:"ERROR_HANDLE_EOF",msg:"Reached the end of the file.",note:"讀到檔案結尾"},{code:"50",name:"ERROR_NOT_SUPPORTED",msg:"The request is not supported.",note:"不支援這個要求"},{code:"53",name:"ERROR_BAD_NETPATH",msg:"The network path was not found.",note:"找不到網路路徑（主機名稱或共用名稱錯誤）"},{code:"55",name:"ERROR_DEV_NOT_EXIST",msg:"The specified network resource or device is no longer available.",note:"網路資源或裝置已消失"},{code:"65",name:"ERROR_NETWORK_ACCESS_DENIED",msg:"Network access is denied.",note:"網路存取被拒"},{code:"67",name:"ERROR_BAD_NET_NAME",msg:"The network name cannot be found.",note:"找不到網路名稱（共用資料夾名稱錯誤）"},{code:"80",name:"ERROR_FILE_EXISTS",msg:"The file exists.",note:"檔案已存在"},{code:"82",name:"ERROR_CANNOT_MAKE",msg:"The directory or file cannot be created.",note:"無法建立"},{code:"87",name:"ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER",msg:"The parameter is incorrect.",note:"參數不正確：旗標組合不合法、結構欄位未初始化、值超出範圍"},{code:"89",name:"ERROR_NO_PROC_SLOTS",msg:"The system cannot start another process at this time.",note:"暫時無法再啟動行程"},{code:"109",name:"ERROR_BROKEN_PIPE",msg:"The pipe has been ended.",note:"管線已結束（對方關閉）"},{code:"112",name:"ERROR_DISK_FULL",msg:"There is not enough space on the disk.",note:"磁碟空間不足"},{code:"122",name:"ERROR_INSUFFICIENT_BUFFER",msg:"The data area passed to a system call is too small.",note:"緩衝區太小：用回傳的所需大小重新配置後再呼叫"},{code:"123",name:"ERROR_INVALID_NAME",msg:"The filename, directory name, or volume label syntax is incorrect.",note:"檔名、資料夾名稱或磁碟標籤的語法錯誤（含非法字元）"},{code:"126",name:"ERROR_MOD_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified module could not be found.",note:"找不到模組：LoadLibrary 載入 DLL 失敗，常因缺少相依的 DLL（用 Dependencies 工具檢查）"},{code:"127",name:"ERROR_PROC_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified procedure could not be found.",note:"找不到函式：GetProcAddress 失敗，DLL 版本不符或匯出名稱錯"},{code:"145",name:"ERROR_DIR_NOT_EMPTY",msg:"The directory is not empty.",note:"資料夾不是空的"},{code:"158",name:"ERROR_NOT_LOCKED",msg:"The segment is already unlocked.",note:"已經解除鎖定"},{code:"170",name:"ERROR_BUSY",msg:"The requested resource is in use.",note:"資源使用中"},{code:"183",name:"ERROR_ALREADY_EXISTS",msg:"Cannot create a file when that file already exists.",note:"已經存在（建立檔案、具名物件如 mutex／event 時；常用來偵測程式重複執行）"},{code:"193",name:"ERROR_BAD_EXE_FORMAT",msg:"%1 is not a valid Win32 application.",note:"不是有效的 Win32 應用程式（32／64 位元不符、檔案損毀）"},{code:"206",name:"ERROR_FILENAME_EXCED_RANGE",msg:"The filename or extension is too long.",note:"檔名或路徑太長（超過 MAX_PATH 260；可用 \\\\?\\ 前綴或啟用長路徑）"},{code:"216",name:"ERROR_EXE_MACHINE_TYPE_MISMATCH",msg:"This version of %1 is not compatible with the version of Windows you're running.",note:"執行檔的 CPU 架構與系統不符"},{code:"231",name:"ERROR_PIPE_BUSY",msg:"All pipe instances are busy.",note:"具名管線的所有執行個體都忙碌"},{code:"232",name:"ERROR_NO_DATA",msg:"The pipe is being closed.",note:"管線正在關閉"},{code:"234",name:"ERROR_MORE_DATA",msg:"More data is available.",note:"還有更多資料：緩衝區放不下，需再讀或加大緩衝區（不是失敗）"},{code:"258",name:"WAIT_TIMEOUT",msg:"The wait operation timed out.",note:"等待逾時"},{code:"259",name:"ERROR_NO_MORE_ITEMS",msg:"No more data is available.",note:"列舉結束"},{code:"267",name:"ERROR_DIRECTORY",msg:"The directory name is invalid.",note:"資料夾名稱無效（或對檔案當資料夾用）"},{code:"298",name:"ERROR_TOO_MANY_POSTS",msg:"Too many posts were made to a semaphore.",note:"號誌釋放次數過多"},{code:"299",name:"ERROR_PARTIAL_COPY",msg:"Only part of a ReadProcessMemory or WriteProcessMemory request was completed.",note:"只完成部分記憶體讀寫（目標位址部分不可存取）"},{code:"317",name:"ERROR_MR_MID_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The system cannot find message text for message number in the message file.",note:"找不到訊息文字（FormatMessage 常見）"},{code:"377",name:"ERROR_NOT_ENOUGH_QUOTA",msg:"Not enough quota is available to process this command.",note:"配額不足"},{code:"487",name:"ERROR_INVALID_ADDRESS",msg:"Attempt to access invalid address.",note:"存取無效位址"},{code:"534",name:"ERROR_ARITHMETIC_OVERFLOW",msg:"Arithmetic result exceeded 32 bits.",note:"算術結果溢位"},{code:"535",name:"ERROR_PIPE_CONNECTED",msg:"There is a process on other end of the pipe.",note:"管線另一端已有行程連上（ConnectNamedPipe 的正常情況）"},{code:"536",name:"ERROR_PIPE_LISTENING",msg:"Waiting for a process to open the other end of the pipe.",note:"等待另一端開啟管線"},{code:"565",name:"ERROR_TOO_MANY_THREADS",msg:"Too many threads.",note:"執行緒太多"},{code:"577",name:"ERROR_INVALID_IMAGE_HASH",msg:"Windows cannot verify the digital signature for this file.",note:"無法驗證檔案的數位簽章（驅動或程式簽章問題）"},{code:"593",name:"ERROR_INVALID_CREATE_FLAGS",msg:"Invalid flags.",note:"旗標無效"},{code:"740",name:"ERROR_ELEVATION_REQUIRED",msg:"The requested operation requires elevation.",note:"需要提高權限（以系統管理員身分執行）"},{code:"997",name:"ERROR_IO_PENDING",msg:"Overlapped I/O operation is in progress.",note:"重疊 I/O 進行中（非同步的正常回傳，不是失敗）"},{code:"998",name:"ERROR_NOACCESS",msg:"Invalid access to memory location.",note:"記憶體存取無效"},{code:"1004",name:"ERROR_INVALID_FLAGS",msg:"Invalid flags.",note:"旗標無效"},{code:"1008",name:"ERROR_NO_TOKEN",msg:"An attempt was made to reference a token that does not exist.",note:"參考不存在的權杖"},{code:"1058",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_DISABLED",msg:"The service cannot be started, either because it is disabled or because it has no enabled devices associated with it.",note:"服務已停用，無法啟動"},{code:"1060",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_DOES_NOT_EXIST",msg:"The specified service does not exist as an installed service.",note:"服務不存在"},{code:"1062",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_NOT_ACTIVE",msg:"The service has not been started.",note:"服務沒有啟動"},{code:"1053",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_REQUEST_TIMEOUT",msg:"The service did not respond to the start or control request in a timely fashion.",note:"服務沒有及時回應啟動或控制要求"},{code:"1056",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_ALREADY_RUNNING",msg:"An instance of the service is already running.",note:"服務已在執行"},{code:"1067",name:"ERROR_PROCESS_ABORTED",msg:"The process terminated unexpectedly.",note:"行程意外終止"},{code:"1168",name:"ERROR_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Element not found.",note:"找不到項目"},{code:"1210",name:"ERROR_INVALID_COMPUTERNAME",msg:"The format of the specified computer name is invalid.",note:"電腦名稱格式無效"},{code:"1219",name:"ERROR_SESSION_CREDENTIAL_CONFLICT",msg:"Multiple connections to a server or shared resource by the same user are not allowed.",note:"同一使用者以不同認證連到同一伺服器衝突"},{code:"1223",name:"ERROR_CANCELLED",msg:"The operation was canceled by the user.",note:"使用者取消"},{code:"1225",name:"ERROR_CONNECTION_REFUSED",msg:"The remote system refused the network connection.",note:"遠端系統拒絕連線"},{code:"1326",name:"ERROR_LOGON_FAILURE",msg:"The user name or password is incorrect.",note:"使用者名稱或密碼錯誤"},{code:"1331",name:"ERROR_ACCOUNT_DISABLED",msg:"This user account has been disabled.",note:"帳戶已停用"},{code:"1332",name:"ERROR_NONE_MAPPED",msg:"No mapping between account names and security IDs was done.",note:"帳戶名稱找不到對應的 SID"},{code:"1314",name:"ERROR_PRIVILEGE_NOT_HELD",msg:"A required privilege is not held by the client.",note:"缺少所需的特殊權限（例如 SeDebugPrivilege、SeBackupPrivilege）；要用 AdjustTokenPrivileges 啟用，或以系統管理員執行"},{code:"1450",name:"ERROR_NO_SYSTEM_RESOURCES",msg:"Insufficient system resources exist to complete the requested service.",note:"系統資源不足"},{code:"1455",name:"ERROR_COMMITMENT_LIMIT",msg:"The paging file is too small for this operation to complete.",note:"分頁檔太小，提交記憶體超過上限"},{code:"1722",name:"RPC_S_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE",msg:"The RPC server is unavailable.",note:"RPC 伺服器不可用（服務沒啟動、防火牆、名稱解析）"},{code:"1784",name:"ERROR_INVALID_USER_BUFFER",msg:"The supplied user buffer is not valid for the requested operation.",note:"使用者緩衝區無效"},{code:"1813",name:"ERROR_RESOURCE_TYPE_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified resource type cannot be found in the image file.",note:"映像檔裡找不到該資源類型"},{code:"1814",name:"ERROR_RESOURCE_NAME_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified resource name cannot be found in the image file.",note:"映像檔裡找不到該資源名稱"},{code:"1920",name:"ERROR_CANT_ACCESS_FILE",msg:"The file cannot be accessed by the system.",note:"系統無法存取該檔案"},{code:"2250",name:"ERROR_NOT_CONNECTED",msg:"The network connection does not exist.",note:"網路連線不存在"}],winsock:[{code:"10004",name:"WSAEINTR",msg:"A blocking operation was interrupted by a call to WSACancelBlockingCall.",note:"阻塞操作被中斷"},{code:"10009",name:"WSAEBADF",msg:"The file handle supplied is not valid.",note:"控制代碼無效"},{code:"10013",name:"WSAEACCES",msg:"An attempt was made to access a socket in a way forbidden by its access permissions.",note:"socket 權限不允許（例如綁定到被獨占的埠、廣播未設選項）"},{code:"10014",name:"WSAEFAULT",msg:"The system detected an invalid pointer address in attempting to use a pointer argument of a call.",note:"指標位址無效"},{code:"10022",name:"WSAEINVAL",msg:"An invalid argument was supplied.",note:"參數無效（常見：未先 bind 就 listen／accept）"},{code:"10024",name:"WSAEMFILE",msg:"Too many open sockets.",note:"socket 太多"},{code:"10035",name:"WSAEWOULDBLOCK",msg:"A non-blocking socket operation could not be completed immediately.",note:"非阻塞操作暫時無法完成，稍後再試（不是真的錯誤）"},{code:"10036",name:"WSAEINPROGRESS",msg:"A blocking operation is currently executing.",note:"有阻塞操作正在進行"},{code:"10037",name:"WSAEALREADY",msg:"An operation was attempted on a non-blocking socket that already had an operation in progress.",note:"非阻塞 socket 已有操作在進行"},{code:"10038",name:"WSAENOTSOCK",msg:"An operation was attempted on something that is not a socket.",note:"對非 socket 做 socket 操作（socket 已關閉或值無效）"},{code:"10040",name:"WSAEMSGSIZE",msg:"A message sent on a datagram socket was larger than the internal message buffer.",note:"資料報太大或接收緩衝區太小"},{code:"10043",name:"WSAEPROTONOSUPPORT",msg:"The requested protocol has not been configured into the system.",note:"不支援的協定"},{code:"10047",name:"WSAEAFNOSUPPORT",msg:"An address incompatible with the requested protocol was used.",note:"位址家族不支援"},{code:"10048",name:"WSAEADDRINUSE",msg:"Only one usage of each socket address (protocol/network address/port) is normally permitted.",note:"位址（埠）已被使用"},{code:"10049",name:"WSAEADDRNOTAVAIL",msg:"The requested address is not valid in its context.",note:"位址在此環境無效（本機沒有這個 IP）"},{code:"10050",name:"WSAENETDOWN",msg:"A socket operation encountered a dead network.",note:"網路掛了"},{code:"10051",name:"WSAENETUNREACH",msg:"A socket operation was attempted to an unreachable network.",note:"網路不可達"},{code:"10053",name:"WSAECONNABORTED",msg:"An established connection was aborted by the software in your host computer.",note:"連線被本機軟體中止（逾時、通訊協定錯誤）"},{code:"10054",name:"WSAECONNRESET",msg:"An existing connection was forcibly closed by the remote host.",note:"連線被遠端強制關閉（對方崩潰、重設、防火牆）"},{code:"10055",name:"WSAENOBUFS",msg:"An operation on a socket could not be performed because the system lacked sufficient buffer space or because a queue was full.",note:"緩衝區空間不足"},{code:"10056",name:"WSAEISCONN",msg:"A connect request was made on an already connected socket.",note:"已經連線"},{code:"10057",name:"WSAENOTCONN",msg:"A request to send or receive data was disallowed because the socket is not connected.",note:"socket 尚未連線"},{code:"10058",name:"WSAESHUTDOWN",msg:"A request to send or receive data was disallowed because the socket had already been shut down in that direction.",note:"該方向已 shutdown"},{code:"10060",name:"WSAETIMEDOUT",msg:"A connection attempt failed because the connected party did not properly respond after a period of time.",note:"連線逾時"},{code:"10061",name:"WSAECONNREFUSED",msg:"No connection could be made because the target machine actively refused it.",note:"對方主動拒絕（埠沒有服務在聽）"},{code:"10064",name:"WSAEHOSTDOWN",msg:"A socket operation failed because the destination host was down.",note:"目的主機關機"},{code:"10065",name:"WSAEHOSTUNREACH",msg:"A socket operation was attempted to an unreachable host.",note:"找不到通往主機的路由"},{code:"10091",name:"WSASYSNOTREADY",msg:"Network subsystem is unavailable.",note:"網路子系統不可用"},{code:"10093",name:"WSANOTINITIALISED",msg:"Successful WSAStartup not yet performed.",note:"還沒呼叫 WSAStartup"},{code:"11001",name:"WSAHOST_NOT_FOUND",msg:"No such host is known.",note:"找不到主機（DNS 查詢失敗）"},{code:"11002",name:"WSATRY_AGAIN",msg:"This is usually a temporary error during hostname resolution.",note:"名稱解析暫時失敗，稍後再試"},{code:"11004",name:"WSANO_DATA",msg:"The requested name is valid, but no data of the requested type was found.",note:"名稱有效但沒有該類型的紀錄"}],hresult:[{code:"0x00000000",name:"S_OK",msg:"Operation successful",note:"成功"},{code:"0x00000001",name:"S_FALSE",msg:"Operation successful (false)",note:"成功但結果為「否」"},{code:"0x80004001",name:"E_NOTIMPL",msg:"Not implemented",note:"沒有實作"},{code:"0x80004002",name:"E_NOINTERFACE",msg:"No such interface supported",note:"物件不支援要求的介面（QueryInterface 失敗）"},{code:"0x80004003",name:"E_POINTER",msg:"Pointer that is not valid",note:"指標無效（傳了 NULL）"},{code:"0x80004004",name:"E_ABORT",msg:"Operation aborted",note:"操作中止"},{code:"0x80004005",name:"E_FAIL",msg:"Unspecified failure",note:"未指定的失敗（沒有更細的原因，需看其他日誌）"},{code:"0x8000FFFF",name:"E_UNEXPECTED",msg:"Catastrophic failure",note:"嚴重／非預期的失敗"},{code:"0x80070005",name:"E_ACCESSDENIED",msg:"General access denied error",note:"存取被拒（即 Win32 ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED）"},{code:"0x80070006",name:"E_HANDLE",msg:"Handle that is not valid",note:"控制代碼無效"},{code:"0x8007000E",name:"E_OUTOFMEMORY",msg:"Failed to allocate necessary memory",note:"記憶體不足"},{code:"0x80070057",name:"E_INVALIDARG",msg:"One or more arguments are not valid",note:"參數無效（即 ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER 87）"},{code:"0x800700B7",name:"HRESULT_ALREADY_EXISTS",msg:"Cannot create a file when that file already exists",note:"已存在（Win32 183）"},{code:"0