to a trusted root authority",note:"無法建立到受信任根的憑證鏈"},{code:"0x800B0101",name:"CERT_E_EXPIRED",msg:"A required certificate is not within its validity period",note:"憑證過期或尚未生效"},{code:"0x80240022",name:"WU_E_ALL_UPDATES_FAILED",msg:"Operation failed for all the updates",note:"Windows Update 所有更新失敗"},{code:"0x8024402C",name:"WU_E_PT_WINHTTP_NAME_NOT_RESOLVED",msg:"Windows Update Agent could not resolve the proxy or server name",note:"Windows Update 無法解析名稱（網路或 proxy）"}],ntstatus:[{code:"0x00000000",name:"STATUS_SUCCESS",msg:"STATUS_SUCCESS",note:"成功"},{code:"0x00000103",name:"STATUS_PENDING",msg:"The operation that was requested is pending completion",note:"操作進行中（非同步）"},{code:"0x40000000",name:"STATUS_OBJECT_NAME_EXISTS_INFO",msg:"An object name already exists",note:"資訊：物件名稱已存在"},{code:"0x80000005",name:"STATUS_BUFFER_OVERFLOW",msg:"The data was too large to fit into the specified buffer",note:"緩衝區放不下（警告）：已填入部分資料"},{code:"0x80000006",name:"STATUS_NO_MORE_FILES",msg:"No more files were found which match the file specification",note:"沒有更多檔案"},{code:"0x80000011",name:"STATUS_DEVICE_BUSY",msg:"The device is currently busy",note:"裝置忙碌"},{code:"0x80000026",name:"STATUS_LONGJUMP",msg:"A long jump has been executed",note:"執行了 longjmp"},{code:"0x80000002",name:"STATUS_DATATYPE_MISALIGNMENT",msg:"A datatype misalignment was detected in a load or store instruction",note:"載入／儲存指令的資料型別未對齊"},{code:"0x80000003",name:"STATUS_BREAKPOINT",msg:"A breakpoint has been reached",note:"中斷點（int3；除錯器）"},{code:"0x80000004",name:"STATUS_SINGLE_STEP",msg:"A single step or trace operation has just been completed",note:"單步執行完成"},{code:"0xC0000001",name:"STATUS_UNSUCCESSFUL",msg:"{Operation Failed} The requested operation was unsuccessful",note:"操作未成功（通用失敗）"},{code:"0xC0000002",name:"STATUS_NOT_IMPLEMENTED",msg:"{Not Implemented} The requested operation is not implemented",note:"沒有實作"},{code:"0xC0000005",name:"STATUS_ACCESS_VIOLATION",msg:"The instruction at 0x%p referenced memory at 0x%p. The memory could not be %s",note:"記憶體存取違規：讀／寫了無效或未配置的位址（空指標、野指標、使用已釋放記憶體、DEP 阻擋執行）；程式崩潰最常見的原因，等同 Linux 的 SIGSEGV"},{code:"0xC0000008",name:"STATUS_INVALID_HANDLE",msg:"An invalid HANDLE was specified",note:"控制代碼無效"},{code:"0xC000000D",name:"STATUS_INVALID_PARAMETER",msg:"An invalid parameter was passed to a service or function",note:"參數無效"},{code:"0xC000000F",name:"STATUS_NO_SUCH_FILE",msg:"The file does not exist",note:"檔案不存在"},{code:"0xC0000017",name:"STATUS_NO_MEMORY",msg:"{Not Enough Quota} Not enough virtual memory or paging file quota is available",note:"記憶體或分頁檔額度不足"},{code:"0xC0000022",name:"STATUS_ACCESS_DENIED",msg:"{Access Denied} A process has requested access to an object, but has not been granted those access rights",note:"存取被拒"},{code:"0xC0000023",name:"STATUS_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL",msg:"The buffer is too small to contain the entry",note:"緩衝區太小"},{code:"0xC0000034",name:"STATUS_OBJECT_NAME_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Object Name not found",note:"找不到物件名稱"},{code:"0xC0000035",name:"STATUS_OBJECT_NAME_COLLISION",msg:"Object Name already exists",note:"物件名稱已存在"},{code:"0xC000003A",name:"STATUS_OBJECT_PATH_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The path does not exist",note:"路徑不存在"},{code:"0xC0000043",name:"STATUS_SHARING_VIOLATION",msg:"A file cannot be opened because the share access flags are incompatible",note:"共用違規：檔案被別人以不相容模式開著"},{code:"0xC0000054",name:"STATUS_FILE_LOCK_CONFLICT",msg:"A requested read/write cannot be granted due to a conflicting file lock",note:"檔案鎖衝突"},{code:"0xC000005A",name:"STATUS_INVALID_OWNER",msg:"Indicates a particular security ID may not be assigned as the owner of an object",note:"無效的擁有者"},{code:"0xC0000094",name:"STATUS_INTEGER_DIVIDE_BY_ZERO",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Integer divide by zero",note:"整數除以零"},{code:"0xC0000095",name:"STATUS_INTEGER_OVERFLOW",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Integer overflow",note:"整數溢位"},{code:"0xC000001D",name:"STATUS_ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Illegal Instruction",note:"非法指令"},{code:"0xC0000025",name:"STATUS_NONCONTINUABLE_EXCEPTION",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Windows cannot continue from this exception",note:"無法從這個例外繼續"},{code:"0xC0000026",name:"STATUS_INVALID_DISPOSITION",msg:"An invalid exception disposition was returned by an exception handler",note:"例外處理器回傳無效處置"},{code:"0xC000008C",name:"STATUS_ARRAY_BOUNDS_EXCEEDED",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Array bounds exceeded",note:"陣列越界"},{code:"0xC000008E",name:"STATUS_FLOAT_DIVIDE_BY_ZERO",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Floating-point division by zero",note:"浮點除以零"},{code:"0xC0000090",name:"STATUS_FLOAT_INVALID_OPERATION",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Floating-point invalid operation",note:"浮點無效運算"},{code:"0xC00000FD",name:"STATUS_STACK_OVERFLOW",msg:"A new guard page for the stack cannot be created",note:"堆疊溢位（無限遞迴、過大的區域變數）"},{code:"0xC0000135",name:"STATUS_DLL_NOT_FOUND",msg:"{Unable To Locate Component} This application has failed to start because %hs was not found",note:"找不到 DLL：程式啟動失敗（缺少 VC++ 執行階段或相依 DLL），常見訊息「0xC0000135」"},{code:"0xC0000139",name:"STATUS_ENTRYPOINT_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The procedure entry point could not be located in the dynamic link library",note:"在 DLL 中找不到匯出函式（DLL 版本不符）"},{code:"0xC0000142",name:"STATUS_DLL_INIT_FAILED",msg:"{DLL Initialization Failed} Initialization of the dynamic library %hs failed",note:"DLL 初始化失敗，行程將結束"},{code:"0xC0000148",name:"STATUS_INVALID_PARAMETER_MIX",msg:"An invalid combination of parameters was specified",note:"參數組合無效"},{code:"0xC000014B",name:"STATUS_PIPE_BROKEN",msg:"The pipe operation has failed because the other end of the pipe has been closed",note:"管線另一端已關閉"},{code:"0xC0000194",name:"STATUS_POSSIBLE_DEADLOCK",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Possible deadlock condition",note:"可能死鎖"},{code:"0xC000010A",name:"STATUS_PROCESS_IS_TERMINATING",msg:"An attempt was made to access an exiting process",note:"行程正在結束"},{code:"0xC000012D",name:"STATUS_COMMITMENT_LIMIT",msg:"{Out of Virtual Memory} Your system is low on virtual memory",note:"虛擬記憶體（提交額度）用完"},{code:"0xC0000185",name:"STATUS_IO_DEVICE_ERROR",msg:"The I/O device reported an I/O error",note:"I/O 裝置錯誤"},{code:"0xC000020C",name:"STATUS_CONNECTION_DISCONNECTED",msg:"The transport connection is now disconnected",note:"傳輸連線已斷開"},{code:"0xC000021A",name:"STATUS_SYSTEM_PROCESS_TERMINATED",msg:"{Fatal System Error} The system process terminated unexpectedly",note:"系統行程意外終止（會藍屏）"},{code:"0xC0000225",name:"STATUS_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Not Found",note:"找不到"},{code:"0xC0000227",name:"STATUS_ALREADY_COMMITTED",msg:"The specified address range is already committed",note:"位址範圍已提交"},{code:"0xC0000240",name:"STATUS_REQUEST_ABORTED",msg:"The request was aborted",note:"要求被中止"},{code:"0xC000026E",name:"STATUS_VOLUME_DISMOUNTED",msg:"An operation was attempted to a volume after it was dismounted",note:"磁碟區已卸載"},{code:"0xC0000374",name:"STATUS_HEAP_CORRUPTION",msg:"A heap has been corrupted",note:"堆積（heap）損毀：重複釋放、緩衝區溢位、寫入已釋放記憶體"},{code:"0xC0000409",name:"STATUS_STACK_BUFFER_OVERRUN",msg:"The system detected an overrun of a stack-based buffer in this application",note:"偵測到堆疊緩衝區溢位（/GS、__fastfail，也用於 fail-fast 例外）"},{code:"0xC0000417",name:"STATUS_INVALID_CRUNTIME_PARAMETER",msg:"An invalid parameter was passed to a C runtime function",note:"傳給 C 執行階段函式的參數無效"},{code:"0xC0000420",name:"STATUS_ASSERTION_FAILURE",msg:"An assertion failure has occurred",note:"斷言失敗"},{code:"0xC0000602",name:"STATUS_FAIL_FAST_EXCEPTION",msg:"A fail fast exception occurred",note:"Fail-fast 例外：程式偵測到嚴重錯誤主動終止"},{code:"0xC06D007E",name:"VCPP_E_MOD_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Delay-load module not found",note:"延遲載入的模組找不到（Visual C++）"},{code:"0xC06D007F",name:"VCPP_E_PROC_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Delay-load procedure not found",note:"延遲載入的函式找不到"},{code:"0xE06D7363",name:"CXX_EXCEPTION",msg:"Microsoft C++ exception",note:"未被處理的 C++ 例外（例外碼 'msc'）：看例外類型與訊息，常是 std::exception"},{code:"0xE0434352",name:"CLR_EXCEPTION",msg:".NET CLR exception",note:"未處理的 .NET 例外（'CCR'）"},{code:"0x40010005",name:"DBG_CONTROL_C",msg:"Control-C",note:"使用者按 Ctrl+C"},{code:"0x40010006",name:"DBG_PRINTEXCEPTION_C",msg:"Debug print exception",note:"OutputDebugString 產生的例外（除錯器用）"},{code:"0x406D1388",name:"MS_VC_EXCEPTION",msg:"Thread name exception",note:"設定執行緒名稱的特殊例外（除錯器用，可忽略）"}]},commands:{mpirun:{name:"mpirun",aliases:["mpiexec","mpiexec.hydra","mpiexec.mpich","orterun","mpirun.mpich","mpirun_rsh"],summary:"啟動 MPI 程式（MPICH／MVAPICH2 用 Hydra，Open MPI 用 orterun）：在一或多台機器上開 N 個行程",synopsis:"mpirun -np N [選項] 程式 [引數...]",options:[{flag:"-np",arg:"數量",desc:"啟動的 MPI 行程總數"},{flag:"-n",arg:"數量",desc:"同 -np"},{flag:"-ppn",arg:"數量",desc:"每個節點啟動幾個行程（Hydra）"},{flag:"--map-by",arg:"規則",desc:"行程如何分配到節點與核心（Open MPI，例如 ppr:2:node、socket）"},{flag:"--bind-to",arg:"目標",desc:"把行程綁到核心、插座或不綁（core、socket、none）；效能與可重現性相關"},{flag:"-hosts",arg:"主機清單",desc:"以逗號分隔的主機名稱（Hydra）"},{flag:"-f",arg:"檔案",desc:"主機清單檔（Hydra 的 hostfile）"},{flag:"-hostfile",arg:"檔案",desc:"主機清單檔"},{flag:"--hostfile",arg:"檔案",desc:"主機清單檔（Open MPI）"},{flag:"-machinefile",arg:"檔案",desc:"主機清單檔"},{flag:"-host",arg:"主機",desc:"指定主機（Open MPI）"},{flag:"-x",arg:"變數",desc:"把環境變數傳給所有行程（Open MPI）"},{flag:"-genv",arg:"變數 值",desc:"設定所有行程的環境變數（Hydra），例如 -genv MV2_ENABLE_AFFINITY 0"},{flag:"-genvall",arg:"",desc:"傳遞所有環境變數"},{flag:"-env",arg:"變數 值",desc:"為單一程式設定環境變數（Hydra）"},{flag:"-wdir",arg:"目錄",desc:"工作目錄"},{flag:"-launcher",arg:"方式",desc:"遠端啟動方式（ssh、rsh、slurm、ll…）"},{flag:"-bootstrap",arg:"方式",desc:"同 -launcher（Hydra）"},{flag:"-prepend-rank",arg:"",desc:"在每行輸出前加上行程編號"},{flag:"-l",arg:"",desc:"同 -prepend-rank"},{flag:"-oversubscribe",arg:"",desc:"允許行程數超過核心數（Open MPI）"},{flag:"--mca",arg:"參數 值",desc:"設定 Open MPI 元件參數（例如 btl ^openib）"},{flag:"-verbose",arg:"",desc:"顯示啟動過程"},{flag:"-v",arg:"",desc:"顯示啟動過程（詳細）"},{flag:"-iface",arg:"介面",desc:"使用的網路介面"},{flag:"-nolocal",arg:"",desc:"不在本機啟動行程"},{flag:"-launcher-exec",arg:"程式",desc:"指定遠端啟動程式"},{flag:"--allow-run-as-root",arg:"",desc:"允許以 root 執行（Open MPI）"}],subs:{},lists:{}},mpicc:{name:"mpicc",aliases:["mpicxx","mpic++","mpif90","mpifort","mpif77","mpicc.mpich","mpicxx.mpich"],summary:"MPI 編譯包裝：呼叫底層編譯器並自動加上 MPI 的標頭路徑與函式庫（用法同 gcc／g++／gfortran）",synopsis:"mpicc [選項] 檔案... -o 輸出",options:[{flag:"-show",arg:"",desc:"只印出實際呼叫的完整編譯命令，不執行（MPICH／MVAPICH2）"},{flag:"-showme",arg:"",desc:"只印出實際呼叫的完整編譯命令，不執行（Open MPI）"},{flag:"-cc=*",arg:"",desc:"指定底層 C 編譯器 {v}（MPICH／MVAPICH2）"},{flag:"-cxx=*",arg:"",desc:"指定底層 C++ 編譯器 {v}"},{flag:"-compile-info",arg:"",desc:"顯示編譯時的選項（MPICH）"},{flag:"-link-info",arg:"",desc:"顯示連結時的選項（MPICH）"},{flag:"-c",arg:"",desc:"只編譯與組譯成目的檔（.o），不連結"},{flag:"-S",arg:"",desc:"只編譯成組合語言（.s），不組譯"},{flag:"-E",arg:"",desc:"只做前處理（展開 #include、巨集），結果輸出到標準輸出"},{flag:"-o",arg:"檔案",desc:"指定輸出檔名"},{flag:"-x",arg:"語言",desc:"指定輸入檔語言而不看副檔名（c、c++、assembler、assembler-with-cpp、none）"},{flag:"-O0",arg:"",desc:"不最佳化（預設）；編譯最快，除錯最方便"},{flag:"-O1",arg:"",desc:"基本最佳化"},{flag:"-O2",arg:"",desc:"常用的一般最佳化（不含以空間換時間的展開）；發行版預設選擇"},{flag:"-O3",arg:"",desc:"積極最佳化：更多內聯、迴圈展開與向量化；程式碼可能變大"},{flag:"-Os",arg:"",desc:"為縮小程式碼而最佳化（嵌入式常用）"},{flag:"-Oz",arg:"",desc:"比 -Os 更積極縮小（clang）"},{flag:"-Og",arg:"",desc:"為除錯體驗做的最佳化（除錯建置建議）"},{flag:"-Ofast",arg:"",desc:"-O3 加上不嚴格遵守標準的數學最佳化（-ffast-math）；浮點結果可能不同"},{flag:"-g",arg:"",desc:"產生除錯資訊（預設 DWARF），讓 gdb 能顯示原始碼與變數"},{flag:"-g0",arg:"",desc:"不產生除錯資訊"},{flag:"-g1",arg:"",desc:"最少的除錯資訊（只有回溯所需）"},{flag:"-g2",arg:"",desc:"一般除錯資訊（與 -g 相同）"},{flag:"-g3",arg:"",desc:"除錯資訊含巨集定義"},{flag:"-ggdb",arg:"",desc:"產生 gdb 最適用的除錯資訊格式"},{flag:"-gdwarf-*",arg:"",desc:"指定 DWARF 版本 {v}"},{flag:"-Wall",arg:"",desc:"開啟大多數有用的警告（並不是「全部」）"},{flag:"-Wextra",arg:"",desc:"開啟額外的警告（未使用參數、比較有號與無號等）"},{flag:"-Werror",arg:"",desc:"把警告當成錯誤，有警告就編譯失敗"},{flag:"-Werror=*",arg:"",desc:"只把指定警告 {v} 當成錯誤"},{flag:"-Wpedantic",arg:"",desc:"嚴格依標準給出警告"},{flag:"-pedantic",arg:"",desc:"嚴格依 ISO 標準，拒絕非標準擴充"},{flag:"-pedantic-errors",arg:"",desc:"違反標準的地方直接當成錯誤"},{flag:"-Wno-*",arg:"",desc:"關閉警告 {v}"},{flag:"-W*",arg:"",desc:"開啟警告 -W{v}（例如 -Wshadow、-Wconversion、-Wformat=2、-Wunused）"},{flag:"-w",arg:"",desc:"關閉所有警告"},{flag:"-std=*",arg:"",desc:"指定語言標準 {v}（c99、c11、c17、gnu11、c++11、c++17、c++20、gnu++17 …）"},{flag:"-ansi",arg:"",desc:"等於 -std=c90"},{flag:"-I*",arg:"",desc:"增加標頭檔搜尋路徑 {v}"},{flag:"-isystem",arg:"目錄",desc:"增加「系統」標頭檔搜尋路徑（警告會被抑制）"},{flag:"-iquote",arg:"目錄",desc:'只用於 #include "..." 的搜尋路徑'},{flag:"-idirafter",arg:"目錄",desc:"搜尋路徑最後才找的目錄"},{flag:"-include",arg:"檔案",desc:"在每個原始檔最前面強制 #include 該檔"},{flag:"-L*",arg:"",desc:"增加函式庫搜尋路徑 {v}（連結階段）"},{flag:"-l*",arg:"",desc:"連結函式庫 lib{v}.so 或 lib{v}.a（例如 -lm 數學、-lpthread 執行緒、-ldl 動態載入、-lrt 即時）"},{flag:"-D*",arg:"",desc:"定義前處理巨集 {v}（-DNAME 等於 -DNAME=1）"},{flag:"-U*",arg:"",desc:"取消定義前處理巨集 {v}"},{flag:"-shared",arg:"",desc:"產生共享函式庫（.so／.dll），通常要搭配 -fPIC"},{flag:"-static",arg:"",desc:"靜態連結：把函式庫打包進可執行檔，不依賴執行時的共享函式庫"},{flag:"-static-libgcc",arg:"",desc:"靜態連結 libgcc"},{flag:"-static-libstdc++",arg:"",desc:"靜態連結 C++ 標準函式庫"},{flag:"-pie",arg:"",desc:"產生位置獨立執行檔（配合 ASLR）"},{flag:"-no-pie",arg:"",desc:"不產生位置獨立執行檔"},{flag:"-rdynamic",arg:"",desc:"把所有符號匯出到動態符號表（讓 dlsym、backtrace_symbols 看得到）"},{flag:"-pthread",arg:"",desc:"啟用 POSIX 執行緒：編譯與連結都需要（等於 -D_REENTRANT -lpthread）"},{flag:"-fopenmp",arg:"",desc:"啟用 OpenMP：處理 #pragma omp 並連結 libgomp"},{flag:"-fopenacc",arg:"",desc:"啟用 OpenACC"},{flag:"-fPIC",arg:"",desc:"產生位置獨立程式碼（共享函式庫必要；大型 GOT 版本）"},{flag:"-fpic",arg:"",desc:"產生位置獨立程式碼（小型 GOT 版本）"},{flag:"-fPIE",arg:"",desc:"產生位置獨立的可執行檔程式碼"},{flag:"-fno-*",arg:"",desc:"關閉功能 -f{v}（例如 -fno-builtin、-fno-exceptions、-fno-rtti、-fno-omit-frame-pointer）"},{flag:"-fsanitize=*",arg:"",desc:"啟用執行期檢查工具：{v}（address 記憶體錯誤、undefined 未定義行為、thread 資料競爭、leak 洩漏）"},{flag:"-fstack-protector",arg:"",desc:"為有陣列的函式加堆疊保護（Canary）"},{flag:"-fstack-protector-strong",arg:"",desc:"更廣泛地加堆疊保護"},{flag:"-fstack-protector-all",arg:"",desc:"為所有函式加堆疊保護"},{flag:"-fvisibility=*",arg:"",desc:"預設符號可見度 {v}（hidden 讓共享函式庫預設不匯出）"},{flag:"-ffunction-sections",arg:"",desc:"每個函式放自己的段，讓連結器能搭配 --gc-sections 移除未使用的函式"},{flag:"-fdata-sections",arg:"",desc:"每個資料物件放自己的段"},{flag:"-flto",arg:"",desc:"連結時最佳化：跨檔案內聯與最佳化（編譯與連結都要加）"},{flag:"-fno-omit-frame-pointer",arg:"",desc:"保留框架指標，讓除錯與效能分析的回溯更準"},{flag:"-fomit-frame-pointer",arg:"",desc:"省略框架指標（-O1 以上預設）"},{flag:"-fno-strict-aliasing",arg:"",desc:"不假設嚴格別名規則（舊程式碼與核心常用）"},{flag:"-ffreestanding",arg:"",desc:"獨立環境：不假設有標準函式庫（核心、啟動碼、韌體）"},{flag:"-fno-builtin",arg:"",desc:"不把 memcpy、printf 等當成內建函式特別處理"},{flag:"-fcommon",arg:"",desc:"未初始化的全域變數放 common 區（GCC 10 起預設是 -fno-common）"},{flag:"-funroll-loops",arg:"",desc:"展開迴圈"},{flag:"-ffast-math",arg:"",desc:"放寬浮點規則以換取速度（不保證 IEEE 精確）"},{flag:"-fno-exceptions",arg:"",desc:"不支援 C++ 例外"},{flag:"-fno-rtti",arg:"",desc:"不產生 C++ 執行期型別資訊"},{flag:"-fprofile-generate",arg:"",desc:"產生剖析資料用的偵測程式碼（PGO 第一步）"},{flag:"-fprofile-use",arg:"",desc:"使用剖析資料最佳化（PGO 第二步）"},{flag:"-fverbose-asm",arg:"",desc:"組合語言輸出附上註解"},{flag:"-fdiagnostics-color=*",arg:"",desc:"診斷訊息上色：{v}"},{flag:"-fmax-errors=*",arg:"",desc:"最多報 {v} 個錯誤就停止"},{flag:"-m32",arg:"",desc:"產生 32 位元程式碼（x86）"},{flag:"-m64",arg:"",desc:"產生 64 位元程式碼（x86）"},{flag:"-mthumb",arg:"",desc:"產生 Thumb 指令集程式碼（ARM，較省空間）"},{flag:"-marm",arg:"",desc:"產生 ARM 指令集程式碼"},{flag:"-march=*",arg:"",desc:"指定目標指令集架構 {v}（例如 x86-64、native 為本機、armv7-a、armv8-a+crypto、rv64gc）"},{flag:"-mtune=*",arg:"",desc:"針對特定處理器調校排程 {v}（不改變可使用的指令）"},{flag:"-mcpu=*",arg:"",desc:"指定目標處理器 {v}（ARM：cortex-a53、cortex-m4 等；同時決定 -march 與 -mtune）"},{flag:"-mfpu=*",arg:"",desc:"指定 ARM 浮點單元 {v}（neon、vfpv4 …）"},{flag:"-mfloat-abi=*",arg:"",desc:"ARM 浮點呼叫慣例 {v}（soft 軟體浮點、softfp、hard 硬體浮點暫存器傳參）"},{flag:"-mabi=*",arg:"",desc:"指定 ABI {v}（RISC-V：lp64d、ilp32 等）"},{flag:"-msse4.2",arg:"",desc:"允許使用 SSE4.2 指令"},{flag:"-mavx",arg:"",desc:"允許使用 AVX 指令"},{flag:"-mavx2",arg:"",desc:"允許使用 AVX2 指令"},{flag:"-mfma",arg:"",desc:"允許使用 FMA（融合乘加）指令"},{flag:"-mno-*",arg:"",desc:"關閉機器相關功能 -m{v}"},{flag:"-m*",arg:"",desc:"機器相關選項 -m{v}（依目標架構而異）"},{flag:"-pipe",arg:"",desc:"用管線取代暫存檔在各階段傳遞資料"},{flag:"-v",arg:"",desc:"顯示詳細的編譯過程（呼叫了哪些子程式、搜尋路徑）"},{flag:"--version",arg:"",desc:"顯示版本"},{flag:"-dumpmachine",arg:"",desc:"印出目標機器三元組（例如 x86_64-linux-gnu、arm-none-eabi）"},{flag:"-dumpversion",arg:"",desc:"印出編譯器版本"},{flag:"-print-search-dirs",arg:"",desc:"印出編譯器搜尋路徑"},{flag:"-print-file-name=*",arg:"",desc:"印出函式庫 {v} 的完整路徑"},{flag:"-save-temps",arg:"",desc:"保留中間檔（.i、.s、.o）"},{flag:"-M",arg:"",desc:"輸出相依規則（Makefile 格式）並停在前處理"},{flag:"-MM",arg:"",desc:"同 -M 但略過系統標頭"},{flag:"-MD",arg:"",desc:"編譯同時輸出 .d 相依檔（含系統標頭）"},{flag:"-MMD",arg:"",desc:"編譯同時輸出 .d 相依檔（不含系統標頭）；Makefile 增量編譯常用"},{flag:"-MP",arg:"",desc:"為每個標頭加一條空目標，避免標頭被刪除時 make 報錯"},{flag:"-MF",arg:"檔案",desc:"指定相依檔輸出位置"},{flag:"-MT",arg:"目標",desc:"指定相依規則的目標名稱"},{flag:"-Wl,*",arg:"",desc:"把逗號分隔的選項 {v} 傳給連結器（例如 -Wl,--gc-sections、-Wl,-rpath,/path、-Wl,-Map=out.map）"},{flag:"-Wa,*",arg:"",desc:"把選項 {v} 傳給組譯器"},{flag:"-Wp,*",arg:"",desc:"把選項 {v} 傳給前處理器"},{flag:"-Xlinker",arg:"選項",desc:"把一個選項原樣傳給連結器"},{flag:"-Xassembler",arg:"選項",desc:"把一個選項原樣傳給組譯器"},{flag:"-T",arg:"腳本",desc:"使用指定的連結器腳本（嵌入式、核心常用）"},{flag:"-nostdlib",arg:"",desc:"不連結標準函式庫與啟動檔"},{flag:"-nostartfiles",arg:"",desc:"不連結標準啟動檔（crt0）"},{flag:"-nodefaultlibs",arg:"",desc:"不連結預設函式庫"},{flag:"-nostdinc",arg:"",desc:"不搜尋標準系統標頭目錄"},{flag:"-specs=*",arg:"",desc:"使用規格檔 {v}（例如 -specs=nosys.specs、nano.specs，嵌入式 newlib 常用）"},{flag:"--sysroot=*",arg:"",desc:"以 {v} 為根目錄搜尋標頭與函式庫（交叉編譯）"},{flag:"-B*",arg:"",desc:"增加編譯器子程式與資料檔的搜尋前綴 {v}"},{flag:"-pg",arg:"",desc:"產生 gprof 剖析用的程式碼"},{flag:"--coverage",arg:"",desc:"產生程式碼覆蓋率資訊（gcov），等於 -fprofile-arcs -ftest-coverage 並連結 gcov"},{flag:"-r",arg:"",desc:"產生可重定位的目的檔（部分連結）"},{flag:"-s",arg:"",desc:"連結後移除符號表（縮小檔案）"},{flag:"-z",arg:"關鍵字",desc:"傳給連結器的 -z 選項（例如 noexecstack、relro、now）"},{flag:"-Q",arg:"",desc:"顯示每個函式編譯時的統計"},{flag:"-H",arg:"",desc:"顯示每個被引入的標頭"},{flag:"-trigraphs",arg:"",desc:"支援三字元序列"},{flag:"-C",arg:"",desc:"前處理時保留註解"},{flag:"-P",arg:"",desc:"前處理時不產生 #line 標記"},{flag:"-undef",arg:"",desc:"不預先定義系統特定的巨集"},{flag:"-fno-common",arg:"",desc:"未初始化全域變數不放 common 區（重複定義會連結失敗）"}],subs:{},lists:{},inherit:"gcc"},nvcc:{name:"nvcc",aliases:["nvcc.exe"],summary:"NVIDIA CUDA 編譯器：把 .cu 拆成主機程式碼（交給 gcc／MSVC）與裝置程式碼（編成 PTX 或 cubin）",synopsis:"nvcc [選項] 檔案.cu -o 輸出",options:[{flag:"-o",arg:"檔案",desc:"輸出檔名"},{flag:"-c",arg:"",desc:"只編譯成目的檔"},{flag:"-arch=*",arg:"",desc:"目標 GPU 架構 {v}（例如 sm_80 為 Ampere；compute_80 只產生 PTX；native 為本機 GPU）"},{flag:"-gencode",arg:"設定",desc:"指定要產生的虛擬與實體架構組合，例如 arch=compute_80,code=sm_80（可重複，產生支援多種 GPU 的 fatbin）"},{flag:"-code=*",arg:"",desc:"要產生的實體架構 {v}"},{flag:"-O0",arg:"",desc:"不最佳化主機程式碼"},{flag:"-O1",arg:"",desc:"主機最佳化等級 1"},{flag:"-O2",arg:"",desc:"主機最佳化等級 2"},{flag:"-O3",arg:"",desc:"主機最佳化等級 3"},{flag:"-G",arg:"",desc:"產生裝置端除錯資訊（會關閉裝置最佳化，變慢，cuda-gdb 用）"},{flag:"-g",arg:"",desc:"產生主機端除錯資訊"},{flag:"-lineinfo",arg:"",desc:"在最佳化的裝置程式碼中保留行號資訊（效能分析用，nsight 可對到原始碼行）"},{flag:"-std=*",arg:"",desc:"C++ 標準 {v}（c++14、c++17、c++20）"},{flag:"-I*",arg:"",desc:"增加標頭路徑 {v}"},{flag:"-L*",arg:"",desc:"增加函式庫路徑 {v}"},{flag:"-l*",arg:"",desc:"連結函式庫 {v}（例如 -lcublas、-lcudnn、-lcurand、-lcufft、-lcudart）"},{flag:"-D*",arg:"",desc:"定義巨集 {v}"},{flag:"-Xcompiler",arg:"選項",desc:"傳給主機編譯器的選項（例如 -Xcompiler -fopenmp,-Wall）"},{flag:"-Xlinker",arg:"選項",desc:"傳給主機連結器的選項"},{flag:"-Xptxas",arg:"選項",desc:"傳給 PTX 組譯器 ptxas（例如 -Xptxas -v 顯示暫存器與共用記憶體用量）"},{flag:"--ptxas-options=*",arg:"",desc:"傳給 ptxas 的選項 {v}（-v 顯示每個核心函式的暫存器、共用記憶體、spill 數）"},{flag:"-maxrregcount=*",arg:"",desc:"限制每個執行緒最多使用 {v} 個暫存器（提高佔用率，可能造成 spill）"},{flag:"--use_fast_math",arg:"",desc:"使用快速但精度較低的數學函式"},{flag:"-ftz=*",arg:"",desc:"把非正規化浮點數視為零 {v}"},{flag:"-prec-div=*",arg:"",desc:"除法精確度 {v}"},{flag:"-prec-sqrt=*",arg:"",desc:"平方根精確度 {v}"},{flag:"-rdc=*",arg:"",desc:"可重定位的裝置程式碼 {v}（true 才能跨檔案呼叫 __device__ 函式，也是動態平行必要）"},{flag:"-dc",arg:"",desc:"編譯成可重定位裝置目的檔（等於 -rdc=true -c）"},{flag:"-dlink",arg:"",desc:"連結可重定位的裝置程式碼"},{flag:"-ptx",arg:"",desc:"只產生 PTX 檔"},{flag:"-cubin",arg:"",desc:"只產生 cubin（特定架構的機器碼）"},{flag:"-fatbin",arg:"",desc:"只產生 fatbin"},{flag:"-keep",arg:"",desc:"保留所有中間檔（可看 .ptx、.cubin）"},{flag:"-lcuda",arg:"",desc:"連結 CUDA 驅動程式 API"},{flag:"-shared",arg:"",desc:"產生共享函式庫"},{flag:"-Xcudafe",arg:"選項",desc:"傳給 CUDA 前端的選項（例如 --diag_suppress=）"},{flag:"-extended-lambda",arg:"",desc:"允許在 __host__ __device__ 與 __global__ 的 lambda 使用擴充語法"},{flag:"--expt-relaxed-constexpr",arg:"",desc:"讓裝置程式碼可呼叫主機的 constexpr 函式"},{flag:"--expt-extended-lambda",arg:"",desc:"同 -extended-lambda"},{flag:"-v",arg:"",desc:"顯示編譯步驟"},{flag:"--version",arg:"",desc:"顯示版本"},{flag:"-ccbin",arg:"編譯器",desc:"指定主機編譯器"},{flag:"-pg",arg:"",desc:"剖析"},{flag:"-t",arg:"數量",desc:"平行編譯多個架構的執行緒數"},{flag:"--threads",arg:"數量",desc:"平行編譯執行緒數"}],subs:{},lists:{}},"nvidia-smi":{name:"nvidia-smi",aliases:["nvidia-smi.exe"],summary:"NVIDIA 系統管理介面：查看與管理 GPU（使用率、記憶體、溫度、執行中的行程、拓撲）",synopsis:"nvidia-smi [選項]",options:[{flag:"-L",arg:"",desc:"列出所有 GPU 與 UUID"},{flag:"-l",arg:"秒數",desc:"每隔幾秒重複顯示"},{flag:"-i",arg:"編號",desc:"只看指定 GPU"},{flag:"-q",arg:"",desc:"顯示所有詳細資訊"},{flag:"-d",arg:"類別",desc:"只顯示指定類別（MEMORY、UTILIZATION、ECC、TEMPERATURE、POWER、CLOCK、PIDS…）"},{flag:"--query-gpu=*",arg:"",desc:"查詢指定欄位 {v}（例如 name,memory.used,utilization.gpu）"},{flag:"--format=*",arg:"",desc:"輸出格式 {v}（csv、noheader、nounits）"},{flag:"-pm",arg:"0|1",desc:"設定持久模式（需要 root）"},{flag:"-pl",arg:"瓦數",desc:"設定功耗上限（需要 root）"},{flag:"-c",arg:"模式",desc:"設定運算模式（DEFAULT、EXCLUSIVE_PROCESS）"},{flag:"-r",arg:"",desc:"重設 GPU"},{flag:"-ac",arg:"設定",desc:"設定應用程式時脈"},{flag:"dmon",arg:"",desc:"持續監看每張 GPU 的功耗、溫度、使用率等"},{flag:"pmon",arg:"",desc:"持續監看每個行程的 GPU 使用"},{flag:"topo",arg:"",desc:"顯示 GPU 與網卡的互連拓撲（topo -m 為矩陣：NV# 為 NVLink、PIX／PXB／PHB／SYS 為不同 PCIe 距離）"},{flag:"nvlink",arg:"",desc:"顯示 NVLink 狀態"},{flag:"mig",arg:"",desc:"管理多執行個體 GPU（MIG）"},{flag:"-mig",arg:"",desc:"啟用或停用 MIG 模式"},{flag:"--gpu-reset",arg:"",desc:"重設 GPU"}],subs:{},lists:{}},"compute-sanitizer":{name:"compute-sanitizer",aliases:["cuda-memcheck"],summary:"NVIDIA 的 CUDA 錯誤檢查工具：偵測越界存取、競爭條件、未初始化記憶體與同步錯誤",synopsis:"compute-sanitizer [選項] 程式 [引數...]",options:[{flag:"--tool",arg:"工具",desc:"檢查工具：memcheck（記憶體錯誤，預設）、racecheck（共用記憶體資料競爭）、initcheck（未初始化的全域記憶體）、synccheck（同步錯誤）"},{flag:"--leak-check",arg:"full|no",desc:"是否回報記憶體洩漏"},{flag:"--show-backtrace",arg:"模式",desc:"是否顯示呼叫堆疊"},{flag:"--log-file",arg:"檔案",desc:"輸出到檔案"},{flag:"--print-limit",arg:"數量",desc:"最多印出幾筆錯誤"},{flag:"--error-exitcode",arg:"碼",desc:"發現錯誤時的退出碼"}],subs:{},lists:{}},"cuda-gdb":{name:"cuda-gdb",aliases:[],summary:"NVIDIA 的 GPU 除錯器（gdb 的擴充）：可在 GPU 核心函式中設中斷點、檢視執行緒與暫存器",synopsis:"cuda-gdb [gdb 選項] 程式",options:[{flag:"-q",arg:"",desc:"不顯示啟動訊息"},{flag:"--args",arg:"",desc:"之後的內容是要除錯的程式與它的命令列引數（gdb --args ./a.out -x 1）"},{flag:"-quiet",arg:"",desc:"不顯示啟動版權訊息"},{flag:"-nx",arg:"",desc:"不讀取任何 .gdbinit 初始化檔"},{flag:"-x",arg:"檔案",desc:"執行指定檔案中的 gdb 命令"},{flag:"-ex",arg:"命令",desc:"執行一條 gdb 命令（可重複）"},{flag:"-iex",arg:"命令",desc:"在載入檔案之前執行一條命令"},{flag:"-batch",arg:"",desc:"批次模式：執行完命令就結束（腳本化、CI）"},{flag:"-p",arg:"行程ID",desc:"附加到執行中的行程"},{flag:"-pid",arg:"行程ID",desc:"附加到執行中的行程"},{flag:"-c",arg:"核心檔",desc:"使用核心傾印檔（core dump）進行事後除錯"},{flag:"-core",arg:"核心檔",desc:"同 -c"},{flag:"-d",arg:"目錄",desc:"加入原始碼搜尋目錄"},{flag:"-cd",arg:"目錄",desc:"以指定目錄為工作目錄"},{flag:"-s",arg:"檔案",desc:"從檔案讀取符號"},{flag:"-e",arg:"檔案",desc:"使用檔案作為可執行檔"},{flag:"-tui",arg:"",desc:"啟動文字介面分割視窗（原始碼＋命令）"},{flag:"-w",arg:"",desc:"使用圖形介面（如果有）"},{flag:"-readnow",arg:"",desc:"一開始就讀完所有符號（啟動慢、之後快）"},{flag:"-b",arg:"速率",desc:"設定序列埠傳輸速率"},{flag:"-l",arg:"逾時",desc:"設定遠端除錯逾時（秒）"},{flag:"-ix",arg:"檔案",desc:"在載入檔案前執行命令檔"},{flag:"--version",arg:"",desc:"顯示版本"},{flag:"-v",arg:"",desc:"顯示版本"},{flag:"--configuration",arg:"",desc:"顯示編譯組態"},{flag:"-return-child-result",arg:"",desc:"結束時使用被除錯程式的退出碼"},{flag:"-silent",arg:"",desc:"不顯示啟動訊息"},{flag:"-dbx",arg:"",desc:"模擬 dbx 指令風格"},{flag:"--eval-command=*",arg:"",desc:"同 -ex：執行命令 {v}"},{flag:"--command=*",arg:"",desc:"同 -x：執行檔案 {v}"},{flag:"--pid=*",arg:"",desc:"附加行程 {v}"},{flag:"--core=*",arg:"",desc:"使用核心檔 {v}"},{flag:"--directory=*",arg:"",desc:"加入原始碼目錄 {v}"},{flag:"--tty=*",arg:"",desc:"被除錯程式的輸出使用終端機 {v}"}],subs:{},lists:{commands:[{name:"run",desc:"啟動被除錯的程式（r）；可帶引數，例如 run -v input.txt"},{name:"start",desc:"在 main 暫停地啟動程式"},{name:"starti",desc:"在第一條指令暫停地啟動（看啟動碼、核心、韌體時用）"},{name:"continue",desc:"繼續執行到下一個中斷點（c）"},{name:"next",desc:"單步執行一行，不進入函式（n）"},{name:"step",desc:"單步執行一行，會進入函式（s）"},{nam