","than","first","been","its","who","now","people","my","made","over","did","down","only","way","find","use","may","water","long","little","very","after","words","called","just","where","most","know","get","through","back","much","before","go","good","new","write","our","me","man","too","any","day","same","right","look","think","also","around","another","came","come","work","three","word","must","because","does","part","even","place","well","such","here","take","why","things","help","put","years","different","away","again","off","went","old","number","great","tell","men","say","small","every","found","still","between","name","should","home","big","give","air","line","set","own","under","read","last","never","us","left","end","along","while","might","next","sound","below","saw","something","thought","both","few","those","always","looked","show","large","often","together","asked","house","don't","world","going","want","school","important","until","form","food","keep","children","feet","land","side","without","boy","once","animals","life","enough","took","sometimes","four","head","above","kind","began","almost","live","page","got","earth","need","far","hand","high","year","mother","light","country","father","let","night","picture","being","study","second","soon","story","since","white","ever","paper","hard","near","sentence","better","best","across","during","today","however","sure","knew","try","told","young","sun","thing","whole","hear","example","heard","several","change","answer","room","sea","against","top","turned","learn","point","city","play","toward","five","using","himself","usually","money","seen","didn't","car","morning","body","upon","family","later","turn","move","face","door","cut","done","group","true","leave","color","red","blue","green","yellow","black","open","close","stop","exit","enter","push","pull","sale","free","welcome","hotel","menu","coffee","tea","pizza","closed","street","road","avenue","north","south","east","west","price","total","email","phone","address","date","start","search","login","logout","sign","save","delete","edit","cancel","ok","yes","please","thank","sorry","hello","warning","error"]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"skin-pale",text:"很淺的膚色（Lab：L 78~96、a 2~14、b 4~20）",tags:["skin","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"skin",L:[78,96],a:[2,14],b:[4,20]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"skin-light",text:"淺膚色（Lab：L 66~88、a 4~20、b 8~28）",tags:["skin","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"skin",L:[66,88],a:[4,20],b:[8,28]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"skin-medium",text:"中等膚色（Lab：L 52~72、a 7~22、b 14~34）",tags:["skin","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"skin",L:[52,72],a:[7,22],b:[14,34]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"skin-tan",text:"偏深的膚色（曬過、橄欖、棕褐）（Lab：L 42~62、a 9~24、b 16~38）",tags:["skin","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"skin",L:[42,62],a:[9,24],b:[16,38]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"skin-brown",text:"棕色膚色（Lab：L 30~50、a 7~22、b 10~32）",tags:["skin","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"skin",L:[30,50],a:[7,22],b:[10,32]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"skin-deep",text:"很深的膚色（Lab：L 16~36、a 3~18、b 3~22）",tags:["skin","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"skin",L:[16,36],a:[3,18],b:[3,22]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"skin-anime",text:"動畫／插畫常見的淡膚色（Lab：L 76~97、a 0~14、b 3~22）",tags:["skin","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"skin",L:[76,97],a:[0,14],b:[3,22]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"hair-black",text:"黑色頭髮（Lab：L 0~26、a -6~10、b -10~12）",tags:["hair","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"hair",L:[0,26],a:[-6,10],b:[-10,12]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"hair-brown",text:"棕色頭髮（Lab：L 14~48、a 2~24、b 4~34）",tags:["hair","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"hair",L:[14,48],a:[2,24],b:[4,34]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"hair-blond",text:"金色／淺黃色頭髮（Lab：L 52~92、a -6~16、b 18~60）",tags:["hair","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"hair",L:[52,92],a:[-6,16],b:[18,60]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"hair-red",text:"紅色／橘紅色頭髮（Lab：L 26~64、a 16~50、b 12~52）",tags:["hair","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"hair",L:[26,64],a:[16,50],b:[12,52]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"hair-gray",text:"灰色／白色頭髮（Lab：L 48~98、a -6~6、b -8~10）",tags:["hair","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"hair",L:[48,98],a:[-6,6],b:[-8,10]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"hair-any",text:"不限顏色（染髮、動畫的鮮豔髮色；只靠位置與形狀判斷）（Lab：L 0~100、a -128~127、b -128~127）",tags:["hair","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"hair",L:[0,100],a:[-128,127],b:[-128,127]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"feature-dark",text:"五官的深色部分（瞳孔、眼睛輪廓、鼻孔、嘴縫）（Lab：L 0~38、a -12~24、b -20~26）",tags:["feature","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"feature",L:[0,38],a:[-12,24],b:[-20,26]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"lip-red",text:"嘴唇的紅色（Lab：L 28~66、a 14~60、b 0~36）",tags:["feature","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"feature",L:[28,66],a:[14,60],b:[0,36]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"fur-light",text:"淺色毛（白、米、奶油）（Lab：L 62~96、a -4~14、b -2~30）",tags:["fur","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"fur",L:[62,96],a:[-4,14],b:[-2,30]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"fur-brown",text:"棕色毛（Lab：L 22~58、a 3~24、b 8~42）",tags:["fur","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"fur",L:[22,58],a:[3,24],b:[8,42]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"fur-dark",text:"深色毛（黑、深灰）（Lab：L 0~34、a -8~16、b -10~22）",tags:["fur","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"fur",L:[0,34],a:[-8,16],b:[-10,22]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"fur-orange",text:"橘色毛（Lab：L 48~78、a 12~40、b 28~66）",tags:["fur","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"fur",L:[48,78],a:[12,40],b:[28,66]}},{kind:"color_family",key:"fur-gray",text:"灰色毛（Lab：L 30~80、a -6~6、b -8~10）",tags:["fur","color"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"fur",L:[30,80],a:[-6,6],b:[-8,10]}},{kind:"joint",key:"neck",text:"脖子：頭部骨架的根，可以前後（x）、左右轉（y）、側傾（z）一點點。",tags:["head-rig"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{offset:[0,0,0],axes:["x","y","z"],rot_min:[-.4,-.8,-.35],rot_max:[.5,.8,.35],rest:[0,0,0]}},{kind:"joint",key:"head",text:"頭：接在脖子上，點頭（x）、轉頭（y）、歪頭（z）。",tags:["head-rig"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{parent:"neck",offset:[0,-.3,0],axes:["x","y","z"],rot_min:[-.5,-1,-.5],rot_max:[.6,1,.5],rest:[0,0,0]}},{kind:"joint",key:"jaw",text:"下巴：接在頭上，張嘴（x）。",tags:["head-rig","mouth"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{parent:"head",offset:[0,.35,.05],axes:["x"],rot_min:[0,0,0],rot_max:[.45,0,0],rest:[0,0,0]}},{kind:"joint",key:"eyelid-l",text:"左眼皮：眨眼（x）。",tags:["head-rig","eye"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{parent:"head",offset:[-.18,-.05,.1],axes:["x"],rot_min:[0,0,0],rot_max:[.9,0,0],rest:[0,0,0]}},{kind:"joint",key:"eyelid-r",text:"右眼皮：眨眼（x）。",tags:["head-rig","eye"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{parent:"head",offset:[.18,-.05,.1],axes:["x"],rot_min:[0,0,0],rot_max:[.9,0,0],rest:[0,0,0]}},{kind:"skeleton",key:"head-rig",text:"頭部骨架：脖子、頭、下巴、兩個眼皮。用來做點頭、轉頭、張嘴、眨眼。",tags:["head-rig"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{root:"neck",joints:["neck","head","jaw","eyelid-l","eyelid-r"],unit:"relative"}},{kind:"machine",key:"blink-cycle",text:"眨眼的階段：睜開 → 閉上 → 睜開。事件 blink 觸發。",tags:["head-rig","eye"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{start:"open",end:["open"],states:{open:{on:{blink:{to:"closed",do:["joint:eyelid-l:rot_x=0.9","joint:eyelid-r:rot_x=0.9"]}}},closed:{on:{release:{to:"open",do:["joint:eyelid-l:rot_x=0","joint:eyelid-r:rot_x=0"]}}}}}},{kind:"motion",key:"blink",text:"眨眼：兩個眼皮 0.15 秒內閉上再睜開。",tags:["head-rig","eye"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{skeleton:"head-rig",duration:.3,loop:!1,ease:"ease_in_out",machine:"blink-cycle",tracks:[{joint:"eyelid-l",keys:[{t:0,rot:[0,0,0]},{t:.15,rot:[.9,0,0]},{t:.3,rot:[0,0,0]}]},{joint:"eyelid-r",keys:[{t:0,rot:[0,0,0]},{t:.15,rot:[.9,0,0]},{t:.3,rot:[0,0,0]}]}]}},{kind:"machine",key:"nod-cycle",text:"點頭的階段：正視 → 低頭 → 抬頭 → 正視。事件 nod 開始。",tags:["head-rig","gesture"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{start:"rest",end:["rest"],states:{rest:{on:{nod:{to:"down"}}},down:{on:{tick:{to:"up"}}},up:{on:{tick:{to:"rest"}}}}}},{kind:"motion",key:"nod",text:"點頭：頭向前低 0.35 弧度再回正，0.8 秒。",tags:["head-rig","gesture"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{skeleton:"head-rig",duration:.8,loop:!1,ease:"ease_in_out",machine:"nod-cycle",tracks:[{joint:"head",keys:[{t:0,rot:[0,0,0]},{t:.35,rot:[.35,0,0]},{t:.8,rot:[0,0,0]}]}]}},{kind:"gesture",key:"nodding",text:"點頭：表示同意、了解。由 nod-cycle 描述階段，用 nod 運動播放。",tags:["gesture"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{machine:"nod-cycle",joints:["head","neck"],motion:"nod",meaning:"同意、了解、肯定"}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"human-eye",text:"人的眼睛：在臉的上半部（約 28%~50% 高度），左右對稱的兩個小橢圓，深色（瞳孔與眼睛輪廓），眼窩略往內凹。",tags:["face","eye"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"face",aliases:["眼睛","eye","eyes"],box:[.08,.28,.92,.5],count:2,symmetric:!0,size:[.004,.05],shape:"ellipse",colors:["feature-dark"],depth:{kind:"sunken",amp:.25},attach:["eyelid-l","eyelid-r"],priority:20}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"human-eyebrow",text:"人的眉毛：在眼睛上方（約 20%~36% 高度），左右對稱的兩條細長橫條，髮色，略微突起。",tags:["face","eyebrow"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"face",aliases:["眉毛","eyebrow"],box:[.08,.2,.92,.36],count:2,symmetric:!0,size:[.003,.04],shape:"bar",colors:["hair-black","hair-brown","hair-blond","hair-red","hair-gray","hair-any"],depth:{kind:"bump",amp:.08},priority:15}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"human-nose",text:"人的鼻子：臉的正中央（水平 35%~65%、垂直 40%~74%），顏色跟臉差不多，沒有明顯的色塊，所以主要靠位置判斷；立體上是臉最突出的地方。",tags:["face","nose"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"face",aliases:["鼻子","nose"],box:[.35,.4,.65,.74],count:1,size:[.01,.1],shape:"blob",colors:["skin-pale","skin-light","skin-medium","skin-tan","skin-brown","skin-deep","skin-anime"],depth:{kind:"bump",amp:.7},priority:10,detect:{prior_only:!0,min_confidence:.2}}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"human-mouth",text:"人的嘴：在臉的下方（水平 25%~75%、垂直 66%~90%），一條橫向的紅色或深色細條，略微凹陷。",tags:["face","mouth"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"face",aliases:["嘴","嘴巴","mouth"],box:[.25,.66,.75,.9],count:1,size:[.004,.06],shape:"bar",colors:["lip-red","feature-dark"],depth:{kind:"sunken",amp:.15},attach:["jaw"],priority:18}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"human-ear",text:"人的耳朵：臉的左右兩側（超出臉的邊界一點），對稱的兩個小橢圓，膚色，略微突起。常被頭髮遮住，所以信心較低。",tags:["face","ear"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"face",aliases:["耳朵","ear"],box:[-.18,.28,1.18,.7],count:2,symmetric:!0,size:[.005,.06],shape:"ellipse",colors:["skin-pale","skin-light","skin-medium","skin-tan","skin-brown","skin-deep","skin-anime"],depth:{kind:"bump",amp:.25},priority:8,detect:{min_confidence:.2}}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"human-hair",text:"人的頭髮：在臉的上方並包住臉的兩側（超出臉的範圍），一大塊髮色的區域，有體積（比臉高）。髮色可以是任何顏色（含染髮、動畫鮮豔髮色）。",tags:["hair"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"hair",aliases:["頭髮","髮","hair"],box:[-.25,-.55,1.25,.45],count:1,size:[.05,1.5],shape:"blob",colors:["hair-black","hair-brown","hair-blond","hair-red","hair-gray","hair-any"],depth:{kind:"bump",amp:.45},attach:["head"],priority:5}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"human-neck",text:"人的脖子：在臉的正下方，比臉窄（水平 20%~80%），膚色，位置比臉後面（凹）。",tags:["body","neck"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"body",aliases:["脖子","neck"],box:[.2,.92,.8,1.5],count:1,size:[.03,.3],shape:"rect",colors:["skin-pale","skin-light","skin-medium","skin-tan","skin-brown","skin-deep","skin-anime"],depth:{kind:"sunken",amp:.3},attach:["neck"],priority:6}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"human-face",text:"人的臉：畫面裡一大塊膚色的橢圓（寬高比約 0.7~1.1），內部上半部有兩隻眼睛、中間鼻子、下方嘴巴，上方與兩側是頭髮。立體上整張臉是一個圓頂（中間高、邊緣低）。膚色涵蓋各種膚色（見 color_family 的 skin-*）。",tags:["face","human"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"face",aliases:["臉","人臉","face"],box:[0,0,1,1],count:1,size:[.02,.7],shape:"ellipse",colors:["skin-pale","skin-light","skin-medium","skin-tan","skin-brown","skin-deep","skin-anime"],depth:{kind:"bump",amp:.55},attach:["head"],priority:30,parts:["human-hair","human-eyebrow","human-eye","human-nose","human-mouth","human-ear"]}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"anime-eye",text:"動畫風格的眼睛：比真人的大（臉的 1%~12%）、多為大塊的深色或有色的圓形／橢圓。",tags:["face","eye","anime"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{base:"human-eye",size:[.01,.12],shape:"blob",depth:{kind:"sunken",amp:.18}}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"anime-face",text:"動畫風格的臉：淡膚色、較平，立體感比真人小；眼睛大、鼻子與嘴小。",tags:["face","anime"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{base:"human-face",colors:["skin-anime","skin-pale","skin-light"],depth:{kind:"bump",amp:.4},parts:["human-hair","human-eyebrow","anime-eye","human-nose","human-mouth","human-ear"]}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"animal-eye",text:"動物的眼睛：臉的上半部、左右對稱的兩個深色橢圓，比例通常比人大，略凹。",tags:["animal","eye"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"animal",aliases:["動物眼睛"],box:[.1,.25,.9,.5],count:2,symmetric:!0,size:[.005,.08],shape:"ellipse",colors:["feature-dark"],depth:{kind:"sunken",amp:.2},priority:20}},{kind:"visual_part",key:"animal-nose",text:"動物的鼻子：口鼻部前端的一小塊深色，略突起。",tags:["animal","nose"],src:"內建種子（經驗值，待以真實圖片校正；使用者與 AI 可以用同 key 覆蓋）",tv:1,customize:{group:"animal",aliases:["動物鼻子","鼻頭"],box:[.4,.55,.6,.72],cou